sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions job
    participant WIF as Workload Identity Federation
    participant DNS as GKE · DNS endpoint<br/>(IAM only)
    participant K8S as API server · RBAC
    participant AUD as Layer 1b<br/>(audit logs)

    GHA->>WIF: OIDC token (exact repo + environment)
    WIF-->>GHA: tf-plan-qa@ or tf-apply-qa@<br/>WITHOUT container.clusters.update
    GHA->>DNS: terramate run -- tofu plan / apply<br/>(helm, kubernetes) with a Google token
    DNS->>DNS: IAM: container.clusters.connect on this cluster
    DNS->>K8S: authenticated request
    K8S-->>GHA: response per RBAC
    DNS-->>AUD: access log
    AUD->>AUD: alert if the principal is not on the list
    Note over GHA,DNS: no authorised networks, no intermediate service,<br/>no concurrency for the API (landing zone DZ4)
